{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/d6755f847707b4504d6c3bcdc0a0250b.poster.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/d6755f847707b4504d6c3bcdc0a0250b.webm?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/d6755f847707b4504d6c3bcdc0a0250b.mp4?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An Epic Journey... Full of Lasers, Explosions, and Ridiculously Good Fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our young hero Zak \u2013 who\u2019s certainly not your average farm boy \u2013 embarks on a quest to find the Ancient Orbs! These aren\u2019t your average orbs, mind you. No, no \u2013 these are REALLY old, REALLY mighty alien gadgets scattered across the five known planets of the galaxy! They\u2019re not just <i>sitting there</i> like some sort of galactic decoration. They\u2019re packed with <i>unimaginable power</i> and the <i>unnecessary complication</i> of making Zak\u2019s life way more difficult than it needs to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/2593071ed50153f14fee25044531df1f.poster.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/2593071ed50153f14fee25044531df1f.webm?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/2593071ed50153f14fee25044531df1f.mp4?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TALES OF THE LASER KNIGHTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Action-Adventure, Comic Sci-Fi B-Movie... with a Seriously Cool <i>Laser Katana</i>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls? Twin-stick shooter style \u2013 you attack, you move, you dodge. It's so simple, it practically teaches itself!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic top-down action: explore, solve puzzles, and hit stuff with your <i>Laser Katana</i> that probably shouldn\u2019t be hit with a <i>Laser Katana</i> (but hey, it\u2019s your universe!).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack</strong>: Composed by Oliv\u00e9r Kov\u00e1cs, bringing you tunes inspired by 80s/90s cartoons and anime. Get ready to feel nostalgic in the most nonsensical way possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/aa0f71cf78fb5e06a67b5c6f4642d81e.poster.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/aa0f71cf78fb5e06a67b5c6f4642d81e.webm?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/aa0f71cf78fb5e06a67b5c6f4642d81e.mp4?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LASERS! EXPLOSIONS! ACTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a galaxy-spanning, laser-fueled extravaganza. And did we mention <i>explosions</i>? Because there are lots of those. Like, a <i>lot</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/a72522ce97d9b31dbcdd4e24de47026f.avif?t=1756372053\" width=600 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your <i>Laser Katana</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine if a Swiss Army knife had a <i>laser sword</i>\u2026 and a few extra <i>booms</i> thrown in. Extend your personal <i>Laser Katana</i> with more <i>features</i> than your last tech gadget that had a \u201cGame-Changing Update.\u201d</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power it up with <strong>Light</strong> <strong>and</strong> <strong>Heavy Attacks</strong> \u2013 because why settle for one when you can have both?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/d38cb219c98ef780ae635464af624fcd.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the powerful <strong>Shield Stomp\u00a9</strong> \u2013 take that, gravity! Or turn it into a Laser Whiplash (don\u2019t ask how that works, we don\u2019t even know).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/5c838804b7a938e028d3e68e825b0cb5.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing over ravines with the super-useful <strong>Laser Grapplehook</strong> (I have absolutely no idea how that could possibly work?! Lasers and grappling???)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/ff1f5ed485a344f28cd28b4fae943914.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Across the Universe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore all five planets in the galaxy, each with its own quirky environment, its own strange flora, and <i>oh yes</i> \u2013 <i>fauna</i> that mostly just wants you to, you know, not <i>exist</i> anymore. You\u2019ll need all the lasers, explosives, and questionable decisions you can muster! But hey, don\u2019t worry about it \u2013 lasers! Explosions! Action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/4ace5e10660952636bc74aa0fce4d9d6.poster.avif?t=1756372053\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/4ace5e10660952636bc74aa0fce4d9d6.webm?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/4ace5e10660952636bc74aa0fce4d9d6.mp4?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zak lives on a <i>boring</i> desert farm. He\u2019s seen one sand dune, and frankly, he\u2019s had enough. Enter Ramius, an ancient warrior who casually mentions that Zak\u2019s whole life is about to get a little <i>more interesting</i>. Turns out, there\u2019s an ancient alien race called <i>The Ancient</i>, who built the Ancient Orbs. These orbs were supposed to unite the planets, but now they\u2019re <i>all gone</i> like a bad sequel to a classic movie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zak\u2019s family had one of these Orbs, and just when Zak thought life couldn\u2019t get worse, it\u2019s <i>stolen</i> by a bunch of weird, faceless soldiers. Zak grabs Ramius' ancient energy weapon, and with nothing but a sword, a dream, and a serious case of teenage angst, he sets off on a galaxy-spanning journey to retrieve these mystical spheres and <i>maybe</i> fix the galaxy along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along his adventures, Zak finds blueprints for more Ancient technology, making his weapon <i>unbelievably</i> powerful. Only with these upgrades will Zak survive the increasingly absurd challenges ahead. And what\u2019s his end goal? To find and defeat the evil villainous forces who stole the Orbs in the first place \u2013 because, naturally, there has to be a villain. It's the <i>law</i> of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/b6a61638df6b3c1dcd35fe0d7c252740.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary in a Nutshell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zak\u2019s just trying to make it as a farm boy. Then bam! Ancient Orbs, lasers, explosions, and lots of very bad guys. Now he\u2019s the galaxy\u2019s last hope. Not bad for a guy who used to milk space cows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to wield your <i>Laser Katana</i>, <i>solve the universe\u2019s problems</i>, and try not to blow up too many things (although, let\u2019s be honest, you probably will).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/31e3f4be232ae1403883f1f46fa41256.avif?t=1756372053\" width=600 height=143 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2512850?t=1756372053","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756372053","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/181c58c22ca1418169b3bd8663705efaf96759ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756372053","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/181c58c22ca1418169b3bd8663705efaf96759ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756372053","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2619890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/d6755f847707b4504d6c3bcdc0a0250b.poster.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/d6755f847707b4504d6c3bcdc0a0250b.webm?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/d6755f847707b4504d6c3bcdc0a0250b.mp4?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An Epic Journey... Full of Lasers, Explosions, and Ridiculously Good Fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our young hero Zak \u2013 who\u2019s certainly not your average farm boy \u2013 embarks on a quest to find the Ancient Orbs! These aren\u2019t your average orbs, mind you. No, no \u2013 these are REALLY old, REALLY mighty alien gadgets scattered across the five known planets of the galaxy! They\u2019re not just <i>sitting there</i> like some sort of galactic decoration. They\u2019re packed with <i>unimaginable power</i> and the <i>unnecessary complication</i> of making Zak\u2019s life way more difficult than it needs to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/2593071ed50153f14fee25044531df1f.poster.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/2593071ed50153f14fee25044531df1f.webm?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/2593071ed50153f14fee25044531df1f.mp4?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TALES OF THE LASER KNIGHTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Action-Adventure, Comic Sci-Fi B-Movie... with a Seriously Cool <i>Laser Katana</i>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls? Twin-stick shooter style \u2013 you attack, you move, you dodge. It's so simple, it practically teaches itself!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic top-down action: explore, solve puzzles, and hit stuff with your <i>Laser Katana</i> that probably shouldn\u2019t be hit with a <i>Laser Katana</i> (but hey, it\u2019s your universe!).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack</strong>: Composed by Oliv\u00e9r Kov\u00e1cs, bringing you tunes inspired by 80s/90s cartoons and anime. Get ready to feel nostalgic in the most nonsensical way possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/aa0f71cf78fb5e06a67b5c6f4642d81e.poster.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/aa0f71cf78fb5e06a67b5c6f4642d81e.webm?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/aa0f71cf78fb5e06a67b5c6f4642d81e.mp4?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LASERS! EXPLOSIONS! ACTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a galaxy-spanning, laser-fueled extravaganza. And did we mention <i>explosions</i>? Because there are lots of those. Like, a <i>lot</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/a72522ce97d9b31dbcdd4e24de47026f.avif?t=1756372053\" width=600 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your <i>Laser Katana</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine if a Swiss Army knife had a <i>laser sword</i>\u2026 and a few extra <i>booms</i> thrown in. Extend your personal <i>Laser Katana</i> with more <i>features</i> than your last tech gadget that had a \u201cGame-Changing Update.\u201d</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power it up with <strong>Light</strong> <strong>and</strong> <strong>Heavy Attacks</strong> \u2013 because why settle for one when you can have both?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/d38cb219c98ef780ae635464af624fcd.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the powerful <strong>Shield Stomp\u00a9</strong> \u2013 take that, gravity! Or turn it into a Laser Whiplash (don\u2019t ask how that works, we don\u2019t even know).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/5c838804b7a938e028d3e68e825b0cb5.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing over ravines with the super-useful <strong>Laser Grapplehook</strong> (I have absolutely no idea how that could possibly work?! Lasers and grappling???)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/ff1f5ed485a344f28cd28b4fae943914.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Across the Universe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore all five planets in the galaxy, each with its own quirky environment, its own strange flora, and <i>oh yes</i> \u2013 <i>fauna</i> that mostly just wants you to, you know, not <i>exist</i> anymore. You\u2019ll need all the lasers, explosives, and questionable decisions you can muster! But hey, don\u2019t worry about it \u2013 lasers! Explosions! Action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/4ace5e10660952636bc74aa0fce4d9d6.poster.avif?t=1756372053\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/4ace5e10660952636bc74aa0fce4d9d6.webm?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/4ace5e10660952636bc74aa0fce4d9d6.mp4?t=1756372053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zak lives on a <i>boring</i> desert farm. He\u2019s seen one sand dune, and frankly, he\u2019s had enough. Enter Ramius, an ancient warrior who casually mentions that Zak\u2019s whole life is about to get a little <i>more interesting</i>. Turns out, there\u2019s an ancient alien race called <i>The Ancient</i>, who built the Ancient Orbs. These orbs were supposed to unite the planets, but now they\u2019re <i>all gone</i> like a bad sequel to a classic movie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zak\u2019s family had one of these Orbs, and just when Zak thought life couldn\u2019t get worse, it\u2019s <i>stolen</i> by a bunch of weird, faceless soldiers. Zak grabs Ramius' ancient energy weapon, and with nothing but a sword, a dream, and a serious case of teenage angst, he sets off on a galaxy-spanning journey to retrieve these mystical spheres and <i>maybe</i> fix the galaxy along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along his adventures, Zak finds blueprints for more Ancient technology, making his weapon <i>unbelievably</i> powerful. Only with these upgrades will Zak survive the increasingly absurd challenges ahead. And what\u2019s his end goal? To find and defeat the evil villainous forces who stole the Orbs in the first place \u2013 because, naturally, there has to be a villain. It's the <i>law</i> of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/b6a61638df6b3c1dcd35fe0d7c252740.avif?t=1756372053\" width=780 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary in a Nutshell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zak\u2019s just trying to make it as a farm boy. Then bam! Ancient Orbs, lasers, explosions, and lots of very bad guys. Now he\u2019s the galaxy\u2019s last hope. Not bad for a guy who used to milk space cows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to wield your <i>Laser Katana</i>, <i>solve the universe\u2019s problems</i>, and try not to blow up too many things (although, let\u2019s be honest, you probably will).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/31e3f4be232ae1403883f1f46fa41256.avif?t=1756372053\" width=600 height=143 /></span></p>","developers":["Heat Haze Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/da5c35b1869b66ddf2f0027771b7ecea7ae49b94/header.jpg?t=1756372053","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}